          }
        },
        "template--14945660534838__0e9480db-2b65-4cc0-b202-8efee389e68a-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p><strong>Revital C Serum:<\/strong> is a boosting complex containing protective and supporting components for the skin.  The combination of antioxidants work synergistically to nourish, protect, and neutralize free radical activity resulting from sun exposure and pollution.<\/p><p><strong>Anti-Aging Peptide Serum:<\/strong>  is designed to target and enhance the biological collapse in the skin's matrix. A major component of this matrix is the development of the skin's proteins categorized as peptides. By replacing the loss peptides of copper, collagen, elastin, polypeptides, and hyaluronic acid, we can revive the strength, integrity, and longevity of our skin.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
