    "b9cffa1f-880e-4cca-a638-5a8cd6e1a355": {
      "type": "text-with-icons",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14945660534838__b9cffa1f-880e-4cca-a638-5a8cd6e1a355-text_block-1": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "plant",
            "title": "L-Ascorbic Acid",
            "text": "<p>L-Ascorbic Acid (Vitamin C) is a potent and refined version of vitamin C that neutralizes free radicals, protecting cells from oxidative damage from sun damage, air pollution and helps brighten the skin and reduce hyperpigmentation <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "template--14945660534838__b9cffa1f-880e-4cca-a638-5a8cd6e1a355-text_block-2": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "plant",
            "title": "Aloe Vera",
            "text": "<p>Organic Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract (Aloe Vera) is rich in nutrients and antioxidants, and offers anti-inflammatory, antimicrobial, humectant properties and soothes the skin. <em> <\/em><\/p>"
          }
        },
        "template--14945660534838__b9cffa1f-880e-4cca-a638-5a8cd6e1a355-text_block-3": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "plant",
            "title": "Hyaluronic Acid",
            "text": "<p>Hyaluronic Acid is a natural mucopolysaccharide that supports moisture content in the skin preventing water loss. It also supports supple stretch and flex and reduces fine lines and wrinkles.   <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "b3b88da6-4284-4b56-9df7-13aeda51d053": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "plant",
            "title": "White Tea Leaf",
            "text": "<p>White Tea Leaf Extract (Camella Sinensis) is high in antioxidants, polyphenols, tannins, and flavonoids.  It is rich in natural anti-inflammatory and protective components. <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "dedecfd6-6acc-49e9-a448-0a9ed91b5811": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "plant",
            "title": "CoQ10",
            "text": "<p>CoQ10 (Ubiquinone) is full of antioxidant properties that protect the skin from environmental stressors. It energizes the skin, supports skin tone, and supports water retention.  <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "0c4695fe-eeb3-41d6-affe-cfbbd59e7585": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "plant",
            "title": "Vitamin E",
            "text": "<p>Tocopherol Acetate (Vitamin E) is a potent oil-soluble antioxidant. It assists in the absorption of vitamin C.  <\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
